# Build context of the Dockerfile: it copies Cargo.*, crates/, skills/ and the
# top-level Markdown files. Everything else (the 7 GB target/, .git, index
# DBs, benchmark results, the npm package) stays out of the context.
**/target
**/.git
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.probe
**/models
**/*.onnx
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
.github
.claude
.claude-plugin
.idea
.vscode
bench
docs
npm
railway.toml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.mcp.json
